cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the public release version and the exact repository commit used. Preserve the source-data citations recorded by each case study."
type: software
title: "Materials Data Analyzer"
authors:
  - name: "jhin0410-lgtm"
version: 2.4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jhin0410-lgtm/materials-data-analyzer"
url: "https://github.com/jhin0410-lgtm/materials-data-analyzer"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A CLI-first research software platform for provenance-aware analysis of
  materials, process, quality, reliability, battery, smart-factory, and
  process-characterization data. The software emphasizes explicit sample
  identity, leakage-aware validation, reproducible artifacts, and separation of
  software validation from scientific claim validity. It does not automatically
  authorize causal, predictive, optimization, mechanism, or engineering-release
  claims.
keywords:
  - materials science
  - manufacturing data
  - process characterization
  - reliability
  - battery data
  - statistical process control
  - provenance
  - reproducible research
